  unitName: Disciple Belfura
  unitId: 20533
  unitNumber: 759
  description: A disciple who descended to Bariura in order to seal an ancient dragon.
    It is said that she did not intend to save the human race by doing this, but
    rather, to preserve the order and balance of the world. At the same time, Grand
    Gaia was battling against the 12 Guardians of the Gods after the deities had
    decided to destroy humankind. However, many speculate that Belfura felt that
    the dragon was a much more imminent threat. Some say that behind her always stood
    a dormant snow and thunder dragon she had sealed with her powers.
  summonDesc: I know not the future of humans.<br>But chaos cannot be tolerated.<br>I
    shall help you.
  fusionDesc: A human lending me power?!<br>Ugh, how humiliating...<br>You will pay
    for this someday.
